<title>FRANCE: AGF 1996 turnover falls 10.4 pct.</title>
<headline>AGF 1996 turnover falls 10.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					69,349    vs   77,414</p>
<p>    Life assurance in France		  22,596    vs   25,785</p>
<p>    Non-Life in France			  19,075    vs   17,632</p>
<p>    International assurance		   20,284    vs   26,809</p>
<p>    Credit assurance			     4,020    vs    2,844</p>
<p>    Reinsurance				    3,374    vs    4,344</p>
<p>Turnover on like-for-like basis stripping out exceptional items						 65,397    vs   62,439</p>
<p>NOTE - The company released the figures in a statement. It said the changes in structure resulted from the sale of units Proteccion, Prevision Vida, among other developments, along with the deconsolidation of reinsurer Scor as of July 1, 1995.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
